  "description": "The new generation of Marley, now available as 29’’ Trail bike. The Marley is now a classic in our range, light, punchy and versatile. A bike designed for the all-round rider that doesn’t break the bank. With hardtails being pushed harder and faster than ever before, a Marley 29’’ simply made sense for the modern Trail rider. Our bikes have always been at the forefront of fun versatile hardtails and with a sprinkle of love with the same Ragley ingredients the Marley has evolved further into the hardtail 29er Trail bike of choice.\nStriking a balance between descending capabilities and all-day riding, the Marley is for riders that ride with the saddle up as much as down. The Marley headtube has now been slackened to 65˚, complimented with a shorter seattube to drop your saddle further, increased reach and 5mm lower BB gives you highspeed confidence and technical stability. Then for when you bang the saddle back up, the steeper 75˚ seat-angle puts you in a comfortable, balanced and efficient pedalling position. More control and more fun like no other hardtail Trail bike, with the updated Trail geometry the Marley 29’’ is at home with epics into the mountains, sweet flat-out singletrack and laps at your favourite trail centre. The Marley 29’’ frame features all the modern no-nonsense fitting standards for easy serviceability. ISCG05 tabs, 44/56mm headtube, internal dropper routing, threaded BB and Boost 148x12mm rear wheel fitting. Engineered from custom butted 6061 Alloy tubing, offering a robust responsive frame but with balanced compliance and comfort.",
